sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio kubeflow-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS SIMPLE
    participant Backend as Backend API Server<br/>4000/TCP HTTP
    participant SAR as Kubernetes API<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    participant Manager as Manager Binary<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Flow 1: REST API Request (Workspace CRUD)

    Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS SIMPLE (gateway-tls-secret)
    Gateway->>Backend: HTTP/4000<br/>Forward request
    Backend->>SAR: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Check verb/resource policy
    SAR-->>Backend: Allowed (user.Info)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: controller-runtime client<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Resource response
    Backend-->>Gateway: JSON response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Admission Webhook (CR Validation)

    Client->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply Workspace/WorkspaceKind
    K8sAPI->>Manager: POST /validate-...<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS
    Manager-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response<br/>(allowed/denied)
    K8sAPI-->>Client: Apply result

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Conversion Webhook

    Client->>K8sAPI: Request WorkspaceKind<br/>(version conversion)
    K8sAPI->>Manager: POST /convert<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS
    Manager-->>K8sAPI: Converted resource
    K8sAPI-->>Client: Converted response

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Flow 4: Controller Reconciliation Loop

    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Watch event<br/>(Workspace/WorkspaceKind change)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Get Workspace CR<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Workspace spec
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update StatefulSet<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update VirtualService<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: Resource status
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Update Workspace status<br/>TLS 1.2+
